  unitName: Flame Demon Adel
  unitId: 10734
  unitNumber: 1090
  description: The demon who founded the new nation of Mildran to the west of Lem
    in ancient Ishgria. Adel's open-mindedness allowed him to put various revolutionary
    ideas into motion for his country. Not only was he extremely independent and
    innovative, but he also boasted of great physical prowess. After founding his
    nation, Adel's next goal was to take down the leader of the demon world and do
    away with the old regime in order to unify Ishgria. No other demon has been known
    to have had such grand ambitions.
  summonDesc: You summoned me here?<br>Then show me!<br>Show me the path you've laid
    ahead!
  fusionDesc: Is this how you accomplish<br>your objectives?<br>I shall accept it.
